{
  "lead": 0.5, "tail": 0.5, "black": 0.3,
  "lines": [
    {"who": "mina", "text": "Okay, but how does he know which recipe I am cooking?", "before": 0},
    {"who": "stamp", "text": "I have a stack.", "before": 0.5},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "A stack of what?", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "Of tokens. Look, he reads them one by one, and he can only do two things.", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "The first one: he puts the token on top of the stack. This is a shift.", "before": 0.3},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "The second one: when the top of the stack is a full recipe, he replaces it. This is a reduce.", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "So the one becomes a value?", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "Not yet! A plus is coming. Shift, shift.", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "And now the two is a value.", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "And number, plus, value...", "before": 0.3},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "...is a value too!", "before": 0.1},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "Shift the parenthesis, and the four of them...", "before": 0.3},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "...are a call!", "before": 0.1},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "When only the first recipe is left, he accepts.", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "And all the boxes are still inside?", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "Yes, this is a tree.", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "But how does he choose between shift and reduce?", "before": 1.0},
    {"who": "stamp", "text": "I look at my map.", "before": 0.5},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "Map?", "before": 0.4}
  ],
